g groups, with p<0.05 considered to be statistically significant.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Chi-square test assessed for differences between males and females; significant level p<0.05.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 3\", \"q\": \"Chi-square test assessed for differences within the four race/ethnicity categories; significant level p<0.05.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}